  "body": "Deadline: Offers in by Monday 23rd November 2026 4pm\r\n\r\nGrand In Scale, Exceptional In Every Detail.\r\n\r\nAs close to brand new as you can get! Beautifully transformed from top to bottom and never lived in since completion, this exceptional 435m2 home offers all the appeal of a brand-new home, with the added reassurance of a build warranty.\r\n\r\nFinished to an impeccable standard throughout, with premium fixtures, top-of-the-line appliances and impeccably presented interiors, every detail has been carefully considered.\r\n\r\nSet on a large fenced 1,020m2 freehold site in a peaceful cul-de-sac, this substantial home combines luxury, space and versatility, perfectly suited to large or multigenerational families.\r\n\r\nThoughtfully designed across two expansive levels, the home provides an abundance of space, privacy and flexibility for modern family living.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the stunning open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, flowing seamlessly onto a deck where you can relax, entertain and enjoy picturesque views across the golf course, with glimpses of the ocean towards both Army Bay and Gulf Harbour. The premium designer kitchen features top-of-the-line appliances and an impressive butler's pantry, offering additional preparation space and practicality for busy family life.\r\n\r\nThe upper level features four generous bedrooms, two bathrooms and two living areas. The luxurious master suite is complete with a walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and direct deck access. Three of the bedrooms open onto the deck, creating a wonderful connection between indoor and outdoor living.\r\n\r\nThe lower level offers exceptional flexibility, featuring two bedrooms, a living and dining area, kitchenette, bathroom, laundry and its own separate entrance. Ideally suited to multigenerational living, this thoughtfully designed space offers independence and privacy. Perfect for extended family, independent teenagers, guests or those exploring potential income opportunities.\r\n\r\nA large internal access double garage and additional off-street parking complete this impressive property.\r\n\r\nPerfectly positioned for family convenience, Wentworth Primary School and Wentworth College are both within easy walking distance, along with local shops, cafes and the golf course. Gulf Harbour marina, restaurants, ferry connections to Auckland City and beautiful beaches are all nearby, offering an exceptional lifestyle in this sought-after coastal community.\r\n\r\nWith Penlink construction well underway and completion expected in 2029, improved motorway access could further enhance convenience and long-term property appeal in the area.\r\n\r\nOffering the freshness and finish of a brand-new home, without the wait, this is an exceptional opportunity to secure a substantial coastal residence ready for its next chapter.\r\n\r\nWhether you're accommodating a growing family, bringing generations together or simply seeking space without compromising on luxury, 20 Admiralty Rise delivers on every level.\r\n\r\nTeam Campbell always welcome conjunctionals, agents, please bring your buyers to the open home!\r\n\r\nWe look forward to seeing you.",
